## Effective phase model

On the certified large-q localized branch, each cell carries a smooth phase angle and an asymptotic `Z2` parity fiber. RG-3 orders pairwise-distinct phases and connects circular neighbors.

For a smooth angular gap delta,

`D_smooth^2(delta)<=C delta^2`

